      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Update: This bug may effect more than just avatar scale. I set up an animation on the FX layer to update a material parameter and when inactive, it caused the material parameter to exhibit weird extreme behavior, similar to the avatar scale issues mentioned here.",
      "viewerReactions": null
